{"id":"u-58a6f557-39d3-40bd-af1f-2feda38cc8ed","src":"community","title":"Uppper Lower Volume Accumulation And Strength","author":"Петро Песенюк","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/z7nTRZ-boostcampcycle30fixed","desc":"Cycle 3.0 is a structured 9-week, 4-day training program designed to build strength, muscle mass, and overall physical development. The program combines strength-focused compound movements with hypertrophy-focused accessory work to provide balanced development of the upper and lower body.\n\nThe program is divided into three stages: Volume Accumulation (Weeks 1–4), Intensification & Strength (Weeks 5–8), and a Deload (Week 9). The first phase focuses on building training volume and establishing a strong foundation, while the second phase gradually increases intensity and shifts toward heavier loads and lower repetitions. The final week reduces training stress to allow recovery and prepare the body for the next training cycle.\n\nEach muscle group is trained twice per week through a combination of compound exercises, isolation movements, and different rep ranges. The program emphasizes progressive overload, controlled technique, adequate recovery, and long-term progression rather than short-term performance. It is designed for intermediate lifters who want to improve both strength and hypertrophy while maintaining a balanced and sustainable training structure.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":120,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-04T12:22:30.854Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["U1 — Strength & Foundation","L1 — Strength","U2 — Hypertrophy","Posterior Chain & Volume"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":6,"rpe":7,"x":4}]},{"n":"T-Bar Row","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tric